7
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
That is part of it.</b></font>

8
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But more than that...</b></font>

9
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:43,420
