<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

13
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:29,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>SPARKLE 1 BECAUSE I MET YOU</b></font>

14
00:02:29,900 --> 00:02:30,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 1A]
Good morning!</b></font>

15
00:02:31,070 --> 00:02:32,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You manage to get
the English homework done?</b></font>

16
00:02:33,610 --> 00:02:35,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 1B] Passed out
barely halfway through!</b></font>

17
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

18
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[yawns]</b></font>

19
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Morning.</b></font>

20
00:02:43,330 --> 00:02:44,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's up?</b></font>

21
00:02:44,670 --> 00:02:45,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey there, Kai!</b></font>

22
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] [chuckles]
Morning!</b></font>

23
00:02:48,290 --> 00:02:50,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Really? More lemon soda today?</b></font>

24
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:51,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA] That's all you've been
drinking lately.</b></font>

25
00:02:52,550 --> 00:02:54,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
So? They're good.</b></font>

26
00:02:54,510 --> 00:02:56,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] Hmm?
Maybe I should try it!</b></font>

27
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where do you normally
pick it up?</b></font>

28
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:01,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MALE STUDENT 1A] Yo, Miura!
-Huh?</b></font>

29
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 1A] Aren't you
a little standoffish?</b></font>

30
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 1B] I don't like
how many looks you're getting.</b></font>

31
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:06,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 1A]
You should go home</b></font>

32
00:03:06,690 --> 00:03:08,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and dye your hair
a normal color.</b></font>

33
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:10,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

34
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:13,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-What?
-You wanna go?</b></font>

35
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:15,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 1B] Wait.
You know you're not supposed</b></font>

36
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:16,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to shake those.</b></font>

37
00:03:18,530 --> 00:03:19,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whoa, chill out!</b></font>

38
00:03:19,740 --> 00:03:21,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp</b></font>

39
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[screams]</b></font>

40
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:24,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 1A]
That's gotta sting!</b></font>

41
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:27,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Oh.
-Well, good luck with that!</b></font>

42
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
What'd you do that for, Kai?</b></font>

43
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:32,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
What? They annoyed me.</b></font>

44
00:03:33,170 --> 00:03:34,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Their fault for dodging.</b></font>

45
00:03:34,670 --> 00:03:36,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take a little responsibility!</b></font>

46
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:38,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, are you okay?</b></font>

47
00:03:38,970 --> 00:03:40,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Someone needs
to get this girl a towel!</b></font>

48
00:03:41,010 --> 00:03:42,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 1C]
Not my problem!</b></font>

49
00:03:42,390 --> 00:03:43,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 1C]
No?</b></font>

50
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Whoa.
Someone's talking to me.</b></font>

51
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's worried about me!</b></font>

52
00:03:48,230 --> 00:03:49,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA]What am I supposed to do?
-[AYUMI] You apologize to her</b></font>

53
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this instant, Kai!</b></font>

54
00:03:51,110 --> 00:03:54,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

55
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's my bad.</b></font>

56
00:03:59,490 --> 00:04:01,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] Try to sound
like you mean it.</b></font>

57
00:04:01,410 --> 00:04:02,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry about him.</b></font>

58
00:04:02,830 --> 00:04:04,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Doesn't even realize
he's being a jerk.</b></font>

59
00:04:07,750 --> 00:04:09,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He's looking at me.</b></font>

60
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura is staring
straight at me!</b></font>

61
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm so sorry!</b></font>

62
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Why are you sorry?</b></font>

63
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:19,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] Why do I feel like
I've seen her somewhere before?</b></font>

64
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's Uka Ishimori.</b></font>

65
00:04:21,470 --> 00:04:22,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's in our class!</b></font>

66
00:04:22,890 --> 00:04:24,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] What?
You're kidding me!</b></font>

67
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:26,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Different vibe
from the rest of us, right?</b></font>

68
00:04:26,980 --> 00:04:28,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

69
00:04:30,230 --> 00:04:32,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] School's always
been difficult for me.</b></font>

70
00:04:32,610 --> 00:04:34,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't made many
good memories.</b></font>

71
00:04:35,690 --> 00:04:38,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I had a nickname
in junior high, "Stony."</b></font>

72
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:41,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[junior high bully chuckles]</b></font>

73
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE JUNIOR HIGH BULLY 1A]
There's just something</b></font>

74
00:04:42,370 --> 00:04:44,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I don't like about her.
-[BULLY] Why doesn't she leave?</b></font>

75
00:04:44,490 --> 00:04:46,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] It seems like
I bother everyone.</b></font>

76
00:04:48,210 --> 00:04:50,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if I had to get splashed,</b></font>

77
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:53,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd rather it be Miura
than someone else.</b></font>

78
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:54,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

79
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:57,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Is that weird?</b></font>

80
00:04:58,550 --> 00:04:59,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I'm caught up!
-[ASUMI] Where'd you get that</b></font>

81
00:04:59,510 --> 00:05:00,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-lipstick?
-Pretty good episode!</b></font>

82
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YURU] I'll take you!
-[UKA] I made up my mind.</b></font>

83
00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:05,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to have more fun
than I did back then.</b></font>

84
00:05:08,230 --> 00:05:11,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though, I don't think
I've made progress.</b></font>

85
00:05:14,860 --> 00:05:15,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]
Everyone!</b></font>

86
00:05:15,820 --> 00:05:17,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Go back to your seats,
so our Day Leader</b></font>

87
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>can get our class off
to a good start.</b></font>

88
00:05:19,490 --> 00:05:20,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All rise.</b></font>

89
00:05:21,990 --> 00:05:23,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Please, Mister Abe.</b></font>

90
00:05:24,030 --> 00:05:25,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know I'm wearing
my gym clothes.</b></font>

91
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:28,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm begging you to not point
it out to everyone.</b></font>

92
00:05:28,790 --> 00:05:31,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE] Wait.
Why are you in gym clothes?</b></font>

93
00:05:32,210 --> 00:05:33,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, Mister Miura?</b></font>

94
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

95
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:40,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold on. You too, Ishimori?</b></font>

96
00:05:40,380 --> 00:05:42,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh. I can explain, sir.</b></font>

97
00:05:42,180 --> 00:05:43,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] We got soda on us.
-[gasps]</b></font>

98
00:05:44,930 --> 00:05:47,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good grief. Wasted no time
causing trouble!</b></font>

99
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:48,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
Aw, c'mon, man!</b></font>

100
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:50,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Tonbo chuckles]
-[MARIN] You good, Kai?</b></font>

101
00:05:51,310 --> 00:05:52,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ABE] Anyway...
-[UKA] But wait.</b></font>

102
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:53,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-it's time to get on with
class. -[UKA] If it got on him,</b></font>

103
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:55,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I didn't see it.
-[ABE] Fine.</b></font>

104
00:05:58,820 --> 00:06:00,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He wasn't in my junior high.</b></font>

105
00:06:02,610 --> 00:06:05,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Actually, I doubt he even
remembers the time</b></font>

106
00:06:05,410 --> 00:06:06,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we met before high school.</b></font>

107
00:06:08,370 --> 00:06:09,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was winter.</b></font>

108
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:15,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And his hair reminded me
of lemon soda.</b></font>

109
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It woke me up.</b></font>

110
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:22,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

111
00:06:24,430 --> 00:06:25,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Mom and Dad.</b></font>

112
00:06:25,890 --> 00:06:27,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hi, honey!</b></font>

113
00:06:27,350 --> 00:06:28,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everything go all right
at school?</b></font>

114
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:30,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Today was fun.</b></font>

115
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's great.
Glad to hear it!</b></font>

116
00:06:32,980 --> 00:06:35,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll have to bring your new
friends over sometime soon!</b></font>

117
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Oh, sure.</b></font>

118
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:38,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can always tell when I see</b></font>

119
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a kid from your school
riding the train.</b></font>

120
00:06:40,530 --> 00:06:42,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not very subtle over there.</b></font>

121
00:06:43,450 --> 00:06:44,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
If you felt like it,</b></font>

122
00:06:44,740 --> 00:06:45,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's not too late
to transfer...</b></font>

123
00:06:46,030 --> 00:06:47,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm exactly where I want to be!</b></font>

124
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, then.</b></font>

125
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:58,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] My parents
are overprotective of me.</b></font>

126
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:01,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel like I can't do anything
for myself.</b></font>

127
00:07:02,050 --> 00:07:03,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that's my fault.</b></font>

128
00:07:04,260 --> 00:07:06,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They spoil me, but I let them.</b></font>

129
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Still...</b></font>

130
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't let things stay
like this anymore.</b></font>

131
00:07:11,930 --> 00:07:13,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!
Starting tomorrow!</b></font>

132
00:07:16,140 --> 00:07:17,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

133
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:27,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got too excited,
and arrived super early.</b></font>

134
00:07:28,030 --> 00:07:29,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I'll make the best of it!</b></font>

135
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good mor...</b></font>

136
00:07:32,740 --> 00:07:34,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
My voice just cracked.</b></font>

137
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll try louder!</b></font>

138
00:07:37,290 --> 00:07:41,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Good morning!
-[KAI] Huh?</b></font>

139
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:43,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

140
00:07:48,220 --> 00:07:49,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Kill me.</b></font>

141
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:53,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Morning.</b></font>

142
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

143
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:00,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
What, ignoring me?</b></font>

144
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:01,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

145
00:08:03,650 --> 00:08:05,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kinda early
for the cold shoulder.</b></font>

146
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No! I'm not!</b></font>

147
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:10,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right. Then repeat after me.</b></font>

148
00:08:10,910 --> 00:08:12,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
"Good."</b></font>

149
00:08:12,530 --> 00:08:13,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good.</b></font>

150
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:15,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] "Mor."
-Mor.</b></font>

151
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:18,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] "Ning."
-Ning.</b></font>

152
00:08:19,250 --> 00:08:20,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Got it?</b></font>

153
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:22,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, uh! Good morning!</b></font>

154
00:08:25,210 --> 00:08:26,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

155
00:08:26,630 --> 00:08:27,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Morning.</b></font>

156
00:08:29,260 --> 00:08:30,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Good morning.</b></font>

157
00:08:31,010 --> 00:08:32,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cellphone vibrates]</b></font>

158
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] What? I'm already here.
-[UKA] He said it.</b></font>

159
00:08:35,770 --> 00:08:36,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] He said it to me!
-Nothin' much.</b></font>

160
00:08:36,850 --> 00:08:38,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just woke up early.</b></font>

161
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Satoru? Grab me a lemon soda
on your way.</b></font>

162
00:08:40,940 --> 00:08:43,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] No one's here.
Just him and me!</b></font>

163
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Endou, answer this one.</b></font>

164
00:08:49,860 --> 00:08:52,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What? How am I supposed
to solve that?</b></font>

165
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI]
By listening.</b></font>

166
00:08:53,450 --> 00:08:55,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stay after school
and you'll learn.</b></font>

167
00:08:55,290 --> 00:08:57,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You think I don't have
anything better to do?</b></font>

168
00:08:57,660 --> 00:09:00,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI] [sighs] Then,
ask a friend for the answer.</b></font>

169
00:09:00,330 --> 00:09:01,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like any of them know</b></font>

170
00:09:01,580 --> 00:09:02,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ayumi screams]</b></font>

171
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:04,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] I need someone
to save me, quick!</b></font>

172
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:06,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Hold on.
I know this one!</b></font>

173
00:09:07,340 --> 00:09:08,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, are you doing okay?</b></font>

174
00:09:09,010 --> 00:09:10,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[AYUMI] I don't wanna stay
late! -[UKA] Should I?</b></font>

175
00:09:10,470 --> 00:09:12,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What if trying to help
makes things worse?</b></font>

176
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:14,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]...screwed if I can't
get a hand from someone.</b></font>

177
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:15,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] We're not friends.
-[AYUMI] Hey, teach,</b></font>

178
00:09:15,430 --> 00:09:17,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you wouldn't really do this
to me, would you?</b></font>

179
00:09:18,390 --> 00:09:19,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
But...</b></font>

180
00:09:19,770 --> 00:09:21,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Here, look at mine!
-Huh?</b></font>

181
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:25,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
You have the answer?</b></font>

182
00:09:28,990 --> 00:09:29,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

183
00:09:30,110 --> 00:09:31,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

184
00:09:31,820 --> 00:09:32,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

185
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Ten by the root of two minus</b></font>

186
00:09:36,790 --> 00:09:38,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>two by the root
of three over three."</b></font>

187
00:09:38,620 --> 00:09:40,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MIZOGUCHI] Correct.
[TONBO] Whoa, incredible.</b></font>

188
00:09:40,660 --> 00:09:42,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] I can't believe
she knew that!</b></font>

189
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:45,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN]
Huh? I zoned out.</b></font>

190
00:09:45,420 --> 00:09:47,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI] All right.
Settle down, kids.</b></font>

191
00:09:47,210 --> 00:09:48,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's move on.</b></font>

192
00:09:52,260 --> 00:09:54,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] They're talking,
but not in a bad way.</b></font>

193
00:09:55,010 --> 00:09:56,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're actually
complimenting me.</b></font>

194
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:59,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe it.</b></font>

195
00:10:00,350 --> 00:10:01,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

196
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:03,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Hey, Ishimori!</b></font>

197
00:10:03,230 --> 00:10:04,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My name's Ayumi Endou!</b></font>

198
00:10:04,900 --> 00:10:07,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks again!
You really saved me!</b></font>

199
00:10:07,610 --> 00:10:09,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, it's no problem!</b></font>

200
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] Hey!
Come on! Time to go!</b></font>

201
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:13,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Ah, you're right!</b></font>

202
00:10:14,490 --> 00:10:15,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You wanna come with us?</b></font>

203
00:10:16,450 --> 00:10:17,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

204
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh. Is that a no?</b></font>

205
00:10:19,950 --> 00:10:21,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry! Yeah!</b></font>

206
00:10:21,540 --> 00:10:22,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

207
00:10:23,620 --> 00:10:24,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Well, hurry up!</b></font>

208
00:10:25,210 --> 00:10:26,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right. Sure thing!</b></font>

209
00:10:29,630 --> 00:10:32,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Did I make a friend? Already?</b></font>

210
00:10:32,340 --> 00:10:34,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
Wow, is that Stony?</b></font>

211
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:35,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S FEMALE FRIEND]
No way!</b></font>

212
00:10:36,010 --> 00:10:37,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought she was gonna go
to Shinsei High.</b></font>

213
00:10:37,890 --> 00:10:39,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, wasn't she?</b></font>

214
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:41,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Think she failed the exam?</b></font>

215
00:10:41,310 --> 00:10:43,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But the only good thing
about Stony's her brains!</b></font>

216
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:45,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-"Stony?"
-That's the nickname</b></font>

217
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>everyone called her
in Junior High.</b></font>

218
00:10:47,230 --> 00:10:48,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For real?</b></font>

219
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:50,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, just look at her!</b></font>

220
00:10:50,110 --> 00:10:52,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, she's slow
and doesn't talk.</b></font>

221
00:10:52,650 --> 00:10:53,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] And all she does is
stare at people</b></font>

222
00:10:54,070 --> 00:10:55,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with a blank face.</b></font>

223
00:10:56,030 --> 00:10:58,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no better name!
Not for a freak like that!</b></font>

224
00:10:58,660 --> 00:10:59,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S MALE FRIEND]
True, true!</b></font>

225
00:10:59,740 --> 00:11:01,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Old Stony can barely
even blink!</b></font>

226
00:11:01,830 --> 00:11:03,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all laughing]</b></font>

227
00:11:03,460 --> 00:11:05,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S MALE FRIEND] Look
at her, just standing there!</b></font>

228
00:11:05,250 --> 00:11:06,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S FEMALE FRIEND]
Right? We couldn't</b></font>

229
00:11:06,420 --> 00:11:07,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>move her if we tried.</b></font>

230
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:09,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S MALE FRIEND]
For real!</b></font>

231
00:11:11,090 --> 00:11:12,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey! Don't listen to them!</b></font>

232
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:15,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S FEMALE FRIEND]
The stone's running!</b></font>

233
00:11:15,590 --> 00:11:17,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

234
00:11:17,090 --> 00:11:18,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No way!</b></font>

235
00:11:18,140 --> 00:11:19,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's leave.</b></font>

236
00:11:19,470 --> 00:11:20,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S FEMALE FRIEND]
Yeah, I'm bored.</b></font>

237
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:22,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did someone call in
the butthead brigade?</b></font>

238
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:24,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like for real for real.</b></font>

239
00:11:24,430 --> 00:11:26,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I guess Ishimori failed
the Shinsei test?</b></font>

240
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:28,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
There's always a chance,</b></font>

241
00:11:28,150 --> 00:11:29,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>she wanted to come here,
ya know.</b></font>

242
00:11:30,020 --> 00:11:31,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Oh, come on.</b></font>

243
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:33,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This place is just
a backup school.</b></font>

244
00:11:33,570 --> 00:11:34,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who'd choose to come here?</b></font>

245
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:41,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I shouldn't have thought
things were getting better.</b></font>

246
00:11:44,870 --> 00:11:46,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm Stony.</b></font>

247
00:11:46,330 --> 00:11:48,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now and forever.</b></font>

248
00:11:52,090 --> 00:11:55,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, wait.
If I think like that,</b></font>

249
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:57,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my life will never change.</b></font>

250
00:12:03,180 --> 00:12:04,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

251
00:12:07,140 --> 00:12:09,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You guys, anyone see
where Kai ran off to?</b></font>

252
00:12:09,900 --> 00:12:11,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No. Not me.</b></font>

253
00:12:11,110 --> 00:12:12,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

254
00:12:12,650 --> 00:12:13,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

255
00:12:15,530 --> 00:12:19,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

256
00:12:23,580 --> 00:12:26,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I HAVE TO CHANGE</b></font>

257
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:28,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] You can't just
tell yourself to change.</b></font>

258
00:12:29,830 --> 00:12:31,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All you're doing is putting
pressure on yourself.</b></font>

259
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:34,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Writing it like that
makes it look like a curse.</b></font>

260
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:36,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What's Miura doing here?</b></font>

261
00:12:36,470 --> 00:12:37,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why is he in the library?</b></font>

262
00:12:38,130 --> 00:12:39,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Aw, c'mon.</b></font>

263
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:40,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm sorry!</b></font>

264
00:12:41,090 --> 00:12:42,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Don't apologize!</b></font>

265
00:12:42,550 --> 00:12:43,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sor...</b></font>

266
00:12:47,390 --> 00:12:48,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm here.</b></font>

267
00:12:49,310 --> 00:12:51,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I actually go to the same
school as him now.</b></font>

268
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:54,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I'm still acting
like a doormat.</b></font>

269
00:12:55,570 --> 00:12:56,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm hopeless.</b></font>

270
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Remi's female friend laughs]</b></font>

271
00:12:58,900 --> 00:13:01,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S FEMALE FRIEND] I got
Stony's shoes from her locker!</b></font>

272
00:13:01,370 --> 00:13:03,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S MALE FRIEND] I swear,
you're always doing this!</b></font>

273
00:13:03,410 --> 00:13:04,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
No kidding.</b></font>

274
00:13:05,950 --> 00:13:07,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

275
00:13:11,500 --> 00:13:13,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, if anyone deserves it,
it's Stony.</b></font>

276
00:13:13,750 --> 00:13:15,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, fine.</b></font>

277
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:16,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S MALE FRIEND]
You jerk.</b></font>

278
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:18,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't come crying to me
if you get in trouble.</b></font>

279
00:13:18,260 --> 00:13:19,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S FEMALE FRIEND]
I think I'll be fine.</b></font>

280
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As if she'd ever say anything!</b></font>

281
00:13:21,220 --> 00:13:22,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Remi's male friend chuckles]</b></font>

282
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:27,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

283
00:13:36,780 --> 00:13:38,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] It's not like this is
anything new to me.</b></font>

284
00:13:39,900 --> 00:13:41,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It doesn't bother me anymore.</b></font>

285
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:46,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I let myself care,
it'll hurt more.</b></font>

286
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:50,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if I harden my heart
like a stone, then I'll...</b></font>

287
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] React, damn it!
-[gasps]</b></font>

288
00:13:55,420 --> 00:13:56,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Go find someone.</b></font>

289
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:58,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ask for help.</b></font>

290
00:14:00,550 --> 00:14:02,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But who?</b></font>

291
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:03,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

292
00:14:06,010 --> 00:14:08,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Why wasn't I able
to pass the Shinsei test?</b></font>

293
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:13,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>School would've been peaceful
without stuff like this, but...</b></font>

294
00:14:13,850 --> 00:14:15,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

295
00:14:16,610 --> 00:14:18,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He told me.</b></font>

296
00:14:19,650 --> 00:14:23,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

297
00:14:28,790 --> 00:14:30,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE TEACHER 1A] You have
nothing to worry about.</b></font>

298
00:14:30,540 --> 00:14:32,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Considering how high
her grades are,</b></font>

299
00:14:32,460 --> 00:14:35,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't imagine she'll have
trouble getting into Shinsei.</b></font>

300
00:14:35,580 --> 00:14:38,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's great news!
Thank goodness!</b></font>

301
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:40,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I can't say that about
any other student going here,</b></font>

302
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:42,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but your daughter is
a special case.</b></font>

303
00:14:42,930 --> 00:14:44,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM] Oh.
Her friends won't be there?</b></font>

304
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:46,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, dear, what do you think?</b></font>

305
00:14:48,430 --> 00:14:49,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's not about where I am.</b></font>

306
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to change who I am.</b></font>

307
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:55,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

308
00:14:57,560 --> 00:15:01,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Still, I wanted to go
to Hachimitsu High.</b></font>

309
00:15:04,610 --> 00:15:05,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S FEMALE FRIEND]
Wait, that's crazy!</b></font>

310
00:15:06,070 --> 00:15:07,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
Right? Isn't it, though?</b></font>

